## Exact next work and unchanged boundary

The next successor is the fixed controller/role event composition. Controller
must authenticate worker READY, then send ARM to guardian and retain guardian
armed proof before release. Broker must exchange every aggregate reservation
offer with controller and receive its exact ACK before issuing CONTINUE.
Controller must verify worker CONSUMED, collect terminal aggregate reports and
own absolute-deadline cleanup.

That successor must consume each final endpoint through its v0.117 authority,
bind listener handoff/adoption, worker privilege drop and final seal, and call
the frozen guardian-v2, ledger and protocol components without caller
callbacks. Full-size bootstrap/source-closure integration and separately
authorized Linux native qualification still follow.

GPU is still unnecessary. No S3 or other remote availability check was made.
Real import, training and production remain disabled. The new source, test and
three records are local and untracked; nothing was staged, committed or pushed.
